  <text>
    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="8">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:IVAtr">IV Atr</ref> 8</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">Et rex suadat et mandat episcopis suis et comitibus et aldremannis et praepositis omnibus, ut curam adhibeant de illis qui tale falsum operantur et portant per patriam, sicut praemissum est, utrobique cum Danis et Anglis.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">And the king advises and commands his bishops and earls and ealdormen and all his reeves that, both among the Danes and the English, they be on the watch for those who coin such base money and spread it abroad through the country, as has been stated above.</ab>
      </div>
    </body>
